  "description": "The leaderboard uses *dense ranking*: the highest score is rank 1, players with equal scores share a rank, and the next lower score gets the next rank with no gaps.\n\nGiven everyone's `scores` and your `score` (which may or may not already be in the list), return the rank you would have.",
